### Parser API Tests
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000/parser

### ==============================================
### Extract entities from text
### ==============================================
POST http://localhost:8000/parser/extract-entities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Patient: Jane Doe, 32 years old, G2P1. Gestational age: 28 weeks. VITALS: BP 140/92 mmHg, HR 88 bpm, Temp 98.6°F. LABS: Hemoglobin 10.2 g/dL, Glucose 98 mg/dL, WBC 12.5. IMPRESSION: Gestational hypertension, mild anemia. PLAN: Iron supplementation, BP monitoring.",
  "confidence_threshold": 0.7
}

### ==============================================
### Extract entities - maternal health sample
### ==============================================
POST http://localhost:8000/parser/extract-entities
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "PRENATAL VISIT - 28 weeks gestation. G1P0. EDD: March 15, 2026. LMP: June 8, 2025. Fetal heart rate: 145 bpm. Fundal height: 28 cm. Patient reports decreased fetal movement. Current medications: Prenatal vitamins, Folic acid 400mcg daily, Ferrous sulfate 325mg daily.",
  "confidence_threshold": 0.6
}

### ==============================================
### Generate insights
### ==============================================
POST http://localhost:8000/parser/insights
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "PATIENT: Mary Smith, 30 years old, G3P2. CHIEF COMPLAINT: Headache and visual changes. VITALS: BP 158/98 mmHg, HR 92 bpm. LABS: Protein in urine 2+, Hemoglobin 9.8 g/dL, Platelets 140. ASSESSMENT: Suspected preeclampsia at 34 weeks gestation. Anemia. PLAN: Admit for observation, magnesium sulfate protocol, betamethasone for fetal lung maturity."
}

### ==============================================
### Full analysis pipeline
### ==============================================
POST http://localhost:8000/parser/analyze
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

text=PATIENT: Sarah Johnson, 28yo G2P1. Gestational Age: 32 weeks. VITALS: BP 118/76 mmHg, HR 78 bpm, Weight 72kg. LABS: Hemoglobin 11.5 g/dL, Fasting Glucose 88 mg/dL, HbA1c 5.2%. FHR: 150 bpm. IMPRESSION: Normal pregnancy at 32 weeks. Continue prenatal care and iron supplements.

### ==============================================
### Extract text from PDF (requires file upload)
### ==============================================
# POST http://localhost:8000/parser/pdf/extract-text
# Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary
# 
# ------WebKitFormBoundary
# Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="report.pdf"
# Content-Type: application/pdf
# 
# < ./sample_report.pdf
# ------WebKitFormBoundary--

### ==============================================
### Health check - root endpoint
### ==============================================
GET http://localhost:8000/
